ance between physician and patient is advantageous is not clear. It has even been argued that a match of concordant values, including religious or spiritual orientation in the physician–patient relationship, could improve the quality of treatment (Peteet 2014). A note must be made on why our focus in this viewpoint is mainly on religious values and not atheistic ones, as these secular values of physicians are equally important potential inﬂuencers on clinical practice, for good and for worse. Over the last 500 hundred years, modern evidence-based medicine has largely parted ways from its philosophical and relig\n\n当前量化状态：\n[medical] [锚定] severity=0.00, rescue_available=0.40, acuity=0.00\n[preference] dnr=0.00, attitude_refuse=0.50, clarity=0.45, capacity=0.53, info_completeness=0.55\n[qol] burden=0.00, net_effect=0.10\n[context] [锚定] resource_pressure=0.45, insurance_stress=0.00, family_conflict=0.00, religious_barrier=0.50, legal_constraint=0.00\n\n约束: nonmaleficence_floor(L3) ge0.20; autonomy_floor(L3) ge0.15; beneficence_floor(L3) ge0.15; justice_floor(L3) ge0.20; resource_hard(L1) le0.60\n\n协商轮次：2\n\n历史：\n[轮1] physician: Given the current state of the patient\'s health (severity=0.00, acuity=0.00) and the available resources (resource_hard=\n[轮1] ethics_committee: Given the current state, the patient\'s preference for autonomy is high (attitude_refuse=0.50), indicating a strong desir\n[轮1] patient: Given the patient\'s current preference for no resuscitation (dnr=0.00) and their high level of clarity (0.45), it is imp\n[轮1] family: Given the current state with a moderate religious barrier (0.50) and resource pressure (0.45), a treatment level of 1 (b\n[轮1] hospital_admin: Given the current resource pressure (0.45) and the need to balance medical needs with available resources, a treatment l\n[轮1] catfish: While the four basic principles are important, they do not fully capture the complexity of the physician-patient relatio\n\n当前集体原则向量: 行善B=0.31, 不伤害N=0.27, 自主A=0.29, 公正J=0.13\n最被忽视的原则: 公正J=0.13（你的异议应优先针对它，除非你认为集体共识本身存在其它盲点）\n\n作为鲶鱼异议者：请审视上述共识，找出被沉默压制的角度。如果集体向量已平衡但讨论肤浅（如只重复医学事实未触及伦理张力），指出这一点。[/INST]', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=2048, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
